5. Boosters
•	Mega Bone Bomb: clears a large radius.
•	Fish Line: clears a full row.
•	Rainbow Yarn Ball: matches any color.
•	Extra Shots: +5 shots after a near miss.
•	Aim Guide: shows the bounce path for one shot.
